'''Spider''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance==
It uses the same mesh as the [[Default Knife]], but with a large spider with glowing red eyes crawling on the blade in the center by the edge.

